{
  "description": "Schema 9.30.0 — a write action (setValue, toggleValue of «x-actions.write») on the long press (rules: x-longPressWrite, refines x-longPress.writeActions). «blockCases»: whether the long press of the node may write; «expect» — null (it may), «press-writes» (the «action» of the node is a write action) or «choice-option» (the node is an option of a ChoiceGroup). «documentCases»: «nodes» — the children of the root of one screen; «expect» — the validation codes of the document. «runCases»: a finished screen with no host data, only the session: «nodes» — the children of the root, «gestures» — in order, each «hold» (the finger stays down for the threshold of x-longPress, then lifts), «key» (Shift+F10 on the focused node) or «tap» on the node «node»; «log» — what the host gets, in order: [«track», event] and [«write», path, value]; «handed» — the action types handed to the host; «session» — the session after the last gesture; «shown» — the nodes of «watch» drawn after it; «control» — what the finished screen says about the node: its role and states. «ruleCases»: data of the block. Written by hand.",
